            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 2.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Aba omukhasi nakhanyala arusia limeeme tawe, alareera kamabongobongo kabili namwe kamauusi kamabaya kabili kamaana, lilala khulwe siianwa sie khukhwosia ne liliindi khulwe siianwa sirusiao bubwoni. Ne omusaayi alakhola kumwiima khurusiao bunyaalu bwo mukhasi oyo, mala alaba omukwalaafu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.8",
